{"version":1,"content":"<p>前無綫新聞主播麥詩敏除轉職主持及KOL，近年更重返校園，早前宣布於香港中文大學營養與食品科學技術理學碩士課程畢業，近日她正式行畢業禮，並網晒戴四方帽的照片，留言分享畢業心情：「正式畢業了！</p><p>成為香港中文大學營養與食品科學技術理學碩士！</p><p>上一次是</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T18:26:01.990523+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T18:01:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T18:19:00.631607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T18:19:00.631607+00:00","content_hash":"e83240359f0dd7af8daa35f48ce016c5590f9a538e2dcbaeacf7a20791f88ab7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}